{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
    "title": "PlanProposal.v1 输出结构",
    "summary": "该 schema 定义规划提案的顶层身份、预期版本字段、步骤、未知项和来源信息，并把每一步限制为五种建议动作及一组可验证字段；它验证 JSON 结构，但不定义版本冲突处理，也不验证证据真实性或计划质量。",
    "category": "requirements",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "proposal",
        "title": "提案身份与版本前提",
        "body": "PlanProposal.v1 是禁止额外顶层属性的对象，必须包含 schema 版本、提案与任务标识、预期版本、步骤、不确定性及来源。[[c1]] `expected_version` 仅被定义为最小值为 1 的整数，即一个预期版本字段；此前将其概括为“并发版本”超出了材料，应由这一较窄结论替代。schema 本身没有规定冲突检测、拒绝、重试或过期处理语义。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "steps",
        "title": "受限动作与步骤闭环",
        "body": "每个步骤禁止额外属性，并要求动作、证据引用、预期产物、验证方式、是否需要所有者决策及停止条件齐全。[[c3]] 动作仅限收集上下文、起草文档、拆分任务、建议提醒和请求决策，因此结构层面把输出约束为有限类型的计划步骤。[[c4]]\n\n不过，`evidence_refs` 只要求是字符串数组，`uncertainties` 也是字符串数组，`origin` 仅要求为对象；schema 未给出非空标识、引用目标存在性或来源必填属性等约束。[[c5]] 这些语义仍需宿主校验、接收流程或行为测试补足。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "提案必填顶层字段",
        "reason": "支持 PlanProposal.v1 顶层结构、必填字段及禁止额外属性的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://omem.invalid/contracts/PlanProposal.v1\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"schema_version\",\n    \"proposal_id\",\n    \"task_id\",\n    \"expected_version\",\n    \"steps\",\n    \"uncertainties\",\n    \"origin\"\n  "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "提案标识与预期版本字段",
        "reason": "支持 schema 版本、提案和任务标识，以及 expected_version 仅被约束为不小于 1 的整数；也说明不能从该字段单独推导并发处理语义。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 15,
          "endLine": 20
        },
        "quote": "  \"properties\": {\n    \"schema_version\": { \"const\": 1 },\n    \"proposal_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"task_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"expected_version\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 1 },\n    \"steps\": {"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "计划步骤必填字段",
        "reason": "支持每一步必须包含证据、产物、验证、所有者决策标记和停止条件的论断。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 21,
          "endLine": 32
        },
        "quote": "      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\n          \"action\",\n          \"evidence_refs\",\n          \"expected_output\",\n          \"verification\",\n          \"needs_owner_decision\",\n          \"stop_condition\"\n        ],"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "允许的规划动作",
        "reason": "支持步骤动作被限制为五种规划操作的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 33,
          "endLine": 41
        },
        "quote": "        \"properties\": {\n          \"action\": {\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"gather_context\",\n              \"draft_document\",\n              \"break_down_task\",\n              \"suggest_reminder\",\n              \"request_decision\"\n            ]"
      },
      {
        "key": "c5",
        "label": "步骤字段与宽松来源结构",
        "reason": "支持 evidence_refs、产物、验证等字段的类型约束，并说明 uncertainties 与 origin 的结构约束较宽松。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 43,
          "endLine": 52
        },
        "quote": "          \"evidence_refs\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n          \"expected_output\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"verification\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"needs_owner_decision\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n          \"stop_condition\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"uncert"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "`origin`、`evidence_refs` 和各类标识是否有 schema 之外的格式或引用完整性校验？",
        "why": "当前 schema 只把来源限定为对象、证据引用和标识限定为字符串，无法阻止空标识、悬空引用或缺少来源细节。",
        "nextStep": "检查宿主侧交叉引用验证；若不存在，为来源结构和证据引用补充明确约束与行为测试。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "question": "当 `expected_version` 与当前任务版本不一致时，提案会被拒绝、重试还是仅提示？",
        "why": "schema 只规定该值为大于等于 1 的整数，没有定义乐观并发、冲突检测或过期提案的处理语义。",
        "nextStep": "查明提案接收流程，并补充版本冲突的合同说明和测试。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
